====Usage notes====
* {{l|nan|澍}} and {{l|nan|𫝺}} usually used when the diameter of the spraying device is smaller, the area sprayed is smaller, or the duration of the spraying is shorter; while {{l|nan|噴}} and {{l|nan|濺}} are usually used in opposite situations or in general sense.<ref name=TLH>{{cite-av|actor=陳豐惠|title=民視台灣學堂|trans-title=Formosa TV Taiwan Lecture Hall|episode=無人機的應用|publisher=民視電視公司 [Formosa Television]|network=YouTube|url=https://youtu.be/VJvCWdZ_hho?t=201|date=2019-07-25|time=03:21|accessdate=2023-11-07}}</ref> But actual usage varies from person to person.
* {{l|nan|霧}} and {{l|nan|浡}} refer specifically to scatter tiny water droplets in the air, or squirting liquid from one's mouth. 
* {{l|nan|掖}} refers specifically to sprinkle liquid, seeds or crumbs from top to bottom. For example, when expressing "sprinkling seeds", one should say {{zh-l|掖種}}.<ref name=TLH></ref>

